SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The aaiioo__rreeaadd() system call is expected to conform to the IEEE Std 1003.1
     (“POSIX.1”) standard.  The aaiioo__rreeaadd22() and aaiioo__rreeaaddvv() system calls are
     FreeBSD extensions, and should not be used in portable code.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The aaiioo__rreeaadd() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 3.0.  The
     aaiioo__rreeaaddvv() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 13.0.  The aaiioo__rreeaadd22()
     system call first appeared in FreeBSD 14.1.

